        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Protestant Reformation</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Where</span><span class="info-stat-val">Arose at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/wittenberg">Wittenberg</a> in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/saxony">Saxony</a> and at Zurich, then spread through the German lands and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/switzerland">Switzerland</a> to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/scandinavia">Scandinavia</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/england">England</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/scotland">Scotland</a>, the Netherlands, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bohemia">Bohemia</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hungary">Hungary</a> and Poland-<a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lithuania">Lithuania</a></span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1517–1648: from Luther’s <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ninety-five-theses">Ninety-five Theses</a> to the Peace of Westphalia; its main churches founded by the 1560s</span></div>
